{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe weather finally cleared this afternoon, and I took a long walk to clear my head. This morning I spent several hours at the Imperial Library, examining works by Raphael and Marcantonio. I tipped the attendants well, for they were helpful, and the collections are open free on fixed days, a pleasant arrangement.\n\nLast evening, the programme ended with the first act of a ballet featuring the German dancer Eberle. I found the performance adequate, though my mind was already on the drawings. I am thinking of you and the boys here. The city is vibrant, but there is no home like Berlin. I hope Karl and Immanuel are well and that Ludwig is behaving himself.\n\nI shall return to the library tomorrow if the light permits. Please give my love to the household.\n\nYour devoted husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080450,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":177,"prompt_tokens":939,"total_tokens":1116,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-IqM4jud5RxESw0FbQOfulcWfKAlVVzKg","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":939,"prompt_ms":934.469,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.995174653887114,"prompt_per_second":1004.8487429759573,"predicted_n":177,"predicted_ms":4229.032,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.02859090909091,"predicted_per_second":41.617088733308236}}